  "story": "A mountain hut logs the lowest temperature of every night. For a study, every stretch of one or more nights in a row gets a score: the coldest reading in it. Add up the scores of all stretches. With readings 3 1 2 the six stretches score 3, 1, 2, 1, 1 and 1, so the answer is 9. A long winter must be finished within the operation budget: going through every stretch is too slow.",
