  "performance": {"required": true, "baselineFactor": 5},
  "hints": ["Group the stretches by the night they end on. For tonight, find the last earlier night that was strictly colder: every stretch that starts after that night and ends tonight scores tonight's reading.", "The stretches that start on or before that colder night score exactly what they scored when they ended on that night. So tonight's sum is tonight's reading TIMES the number of nights since the colder night, PLUS that night's own sum.", "Keep the positions of the nights that may still be someone's colder night in a NEW STACK: POP WHILE the night on top is not colder than tonight, then PEEK. Store every night's sum in a list, add it to the total, and PUSH tonight."],
